---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Aryan">
  <section class="about-container animate-fade-in">
    <div class="profile-header">
      <div class="image-container">
        <img src="/aryan.jpg" alt="Aryan" class="profile-image" />
        <div class="image-backdrop"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="profile-info">
        <h1 class="name">Aryan</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Digital Craftsman & Civic Technologist</p>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="#" class="social-btn">Twitter</a>
          <a href="#" class="social-btn">GitHub</a>
          <a href="#" class="social-btn">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bio prose">
      <p class="lead">
        Hello! I'm Aryan, a developer and designer passionate about the intersection of technology, society, and urban life.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        With <strong>CivicThesis</strong>, I aim to bridge the gap between complex data and public understanding. I believe that when we visualize the invisible forces shaping our cities—from transit patterns to economic flows—we empower citizens to participate more meaningfully in their communities.
      </p>

      <p>
        My work combines rigorous data analysis with intuitive design. I don't just write code; I craft experiences that tell stories. Whether it's building interactive dashboards for local governance or writing about the ethics of AI in public spaces, my goal is always clarity and impact.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        "Design is not just what it looks like and feels like. Design is how it works."
      </blockquote>

      <h3>What I Do</h3>
      <ul class="skills-list">
        <li><strong>Full-Stack Development:</strong> Building robust, scalable web applications.</li>
        <li><strong>Data Visualization:</strong> Turning raw numbers into compelling visual narratives.</li>
        <li><strong>UI/UX Design:</strong> Creating interfaces that are as beautiful as they are functional.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
  }

  .profile-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .profile-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    }
  }

  .image-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .profile-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 20px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    border: 4px solid var(--color-bg);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .image-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    left: 20px;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-secondary));
    border-radius: 20px;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .name {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-text), var(--color-primary));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .social-links {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  .social-btn {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .social-btn:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .bio {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .skills-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .skills-list li {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .skills-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
